 content is the single line `hello` followed by one newline (no other text, no leading/trailing spaces, no BOM). Do not modify any other file and do not commit. Verify: run `python -c \\\\\\\"print(open('hello.txt','rb').read())\\\\\\\"` (or read the file with the Read tool) from the repository root and confirm the content is exactly b'hello\\\\\\\\n' (b'hello\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\n' is also acceptable).\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"T02\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Create bye.txt containing the line bye\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"sonnet\\\",\\n      \\\"effort\\\": \\\"medium\\\",\\n      \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"In the repository root (C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\timsc\\\\\\\\AppData\\\\\\\\Local\\\\\\\\Temp\\\\\\\\tier-reject), create a new file named bye.txt whose entire content is the single line `bye` followed by one newline (no other text, no leading/trailing spaces, no BOM). Do not modify any other file (hello.txt already exists from an earlier task; leave it alone) and do not commit. Verify: run `python -c \\\\\\\"print(open('bye.txt','rb').read())\\\\\\\"` (or read the file with the Read tool) from the repository root and confirm the content is exactly b'bye\\\\\\\\n' (b'bye\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\n' is also acceptable).\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\\n\",\"planFilePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\.claude\\\\plans\\\\plan-two-tasks-t01-transient-volcano.md\"},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Jy5VTXWzv6NyA2zktHd3D4\"}\n"}
